  "scientific_acceptance": [
    "Exactly one clean local synthetic corpus with frozen 32/16/16 roles, one L10 fit and twenty trainable port/time-scale parameters; encoder and physical backbone are frozen.",
    "The actual projected RK4 history response feeds differentiable reduced QR and a triangular solve; only the rank/conditioning diagnostic is detached. No normal equation, ridge, latent target or future observation enters initialization.",
    "The complete history-solve, warmup, visible-origin reset and future rollout retain derivatives; two-block central directional differences are frozen before training.",
    "Training uses only train, exactly 240 Adam updates unless a recorded numerical failure occurs, with no early stopping, best-checkpoint selection, test selection or extra optimization.",
    "True, initial and terminal parameter models all attempt train/val/test evaluation regardless of RMSE. Numerical failures preserve both failed parameters and a labelled last-finite diagnostic snapshot, and do not suppress remaining role attempts.",
    "Numerical exceptions cross the budget scope boundary before handling, retaining failed issued allocations with unknown internal return counts.",
    "Truth-control, numerical correctness, fitted precision and evaluation completion are distinct recorded outcomes; fixed accuracy thresholds do not prevent reporting."
